message: "If you use ANIMA, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "ANIMA – AI Navigator for Informed Mental Health Applications"
abstract: >-
  An open European framework for AI in psychology. ANIMA shows what applies,
  what is recommended and what is known when AI enters psychological work or
  affects people psychologically. Law, guidance of public bodies and standards
  of professional bodies are mapped onto one model: the triad of client,
  practitioner and AI system, with its edges, flows, configurations, frame and
  addressees. Covers psychology as a profession and psychological effects of
  AI, also without any practitioner.
